[68.368996, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H"]
[68.369088, "o", "2. Read the cited renewal conflict\r\n\r\n"]
[68.369147, "o", "Three exact lines from the demo's acc-003 brief:\r\n- CRM opportunity opp-003: stage \"closed_won\"; amount USD 25,500.00; close date 2027-01-10. [crm/opportunities/opp-003]\r\n- Untrusted call note note-003 at \"2027-01-12T15:00:00Z\" says \"Procurement has not approved this renewal. The budget remains unsigned.\". [calls/call_notes/note-003]\r\n"]
[68.369195, "o", "- Source conflict: CRM opportunity opp-003 reports stage \"closed_won\", while call note note-003 reports unapproved procurement. [crm/opportunities/opp-003] [calls/call_notes/note-003]\r\n"]
[68.599322, "o", "Citation checker: valid.\r\n"]
[78.601699, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H3. Keep missing permission visible\r\n\r\nRecorded response excerpt for a CRM-only grant:\r\n"]
[78.601981, "o", "{\r\n  \"status\": 403,\r\n  \"message\": \"insufficient_scope: calls:read required\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[78.601988, "o", "Exact line from the restricted brief:\r\n"]
[78.602014, "o", "- Call notes were unavailable because the token lacks calls:read. [audit/f1e38373-ef0c-4028-9ab5-b38cdb6c3076]\r\n"]
[88.607998, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H4. Reject an uncited sentence\r\n"]
[88.608868, "o", "\r\n"]
[88.60933, "o", "Candidate: the generated brief plus 'The renewal was approved.'\r\n"]
[88.609367, "o", "$ .venv/bin/python -m gtm_connector check-brief brief-1ead875bcc1a45f9b9c41ed2aa593d89 var/recording-d0o8fva5/candidate.txt --state-dir var/recording-d0o8fva5/state\r\n"]
[88.816193, "o", "error: Brief contains an uncited, unsupported, or misattributed statement.\r\nExit: 2. Standard output is empty.\r\n"]
[98.821511, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H5. List tools through the official Inspector CLI\r\n\r\n"]
[101.532827, "o", "Fixture backend. Fresh loopback TLS server and an explicit crm:read grant.\r\n"]
[101.532943, "o", "$ npx --yes @modelcontextprotocol/inspector@2.15.0 --cli --config var/recording-d0o8fva5/inspector-state/inspector.json --server gtm-connector --stored-auth-only --quiet --format json --method tools/list\r\n"]
[102.981847, "o", "Name and required-scope projection of the actual Inspector JSON:\r\n"]
[102.981854, "o", "{\r\n  \"search_accounts\": \"crm:read\",\r\n  \"get_account\": \"crm:read\",\r\n  \"list_opportunities\": \"crm:read\",\r\n  \"read_call_notes\": \"calls:read\",\r\n  \"read_slack_messages\": \"slack:read\",\r\n  \"log_activity\": \"crm:write\"\r\n}"]
[102.981856, "o", "\r\n"]
